      {
        "id": "model-form-focus",
        "moduleId": "if-forms",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "选择写法时先数分支",
        "markdown": "选哪种写法，先看需要处理几条路径：只在条件成立时做一件事，可省略 `else`；成立与不成立都要各自的处理，用 `if…else`；要按区间逐一判断，用 `if…else if…else` 链。三种形式的共同点是条件先求值，然后按结果选择执行路径。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-general-form"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-three-forms",
        "moduleId": "if-forms",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：三种最常用的if形式",
        "markdown": "教材列出最常用的三种形式。\n\n单分支，没有 `else` 子句：\n\n```c\nif (表达式) 语句1\n```\n\n双分支，有 `else` 子句：\n\n```c\nif (表达式)\n    语句1\nelse\n    语句2\n```\n\n多分支，在 `else` 部分又嵌套多层 `if`：\n\n```c\nif (表达式1) 语句1\nelse if (表达式2) 语句2\nelse if (表达式3) 语句3\n    ⋮\nelse if (表达式m) 语句m\nelse 语句m+1\n```\n\n教材以分段折扣为例：\n\n```c\nif (number > 500) cost = 0.15;\nelse if (number > 300) cost = 0.10;\nelse if (number > 100) cost = 0.075;\nelse if (number > 50) cost = 0.05;\nelse cost = 0;\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-ac7818a0e746eafd347c6fa0",
